    "detailed_description": "Immerse yourself in an action-packed low-poly adventure where you take on the role of a warrior fighting skeletons and monsters in an expansive open world. With smooth combat mechanics, the game features a variety of attacks, double jumps, and strategic stamina management. As you explore, you\u2019ll unlock new areas, face challenging enemies, and survive intense battles. Whether you\u2019re a fan of sword fighting or fast-paced action, this game has something for you.<br />\r\nKey Features:<br />\r\n-Open World: Explore vast landscapes filled with hidden dangers and treasures.<br />\r\n-Dynamic Combat: Use a combination of sword strikes, dodges, and special moves to defeat enemies.<br />\r\n-Stamina Management: Keep an eye on your stamina bar to avoid getting overwhelmed.<br />\r\n-Double Jump: Gain an advantage with agile double jumps to outmaneuver foes.<br />\r\n-Engaging Animations: Enjoy smooth, responsive animations that enhance the fighting experience.<br />\r\n-Health System: Manage your HP while battling relentless enemies.",
